{
  "description": "Nightly self-development bot (docs/nightly-self-development.md section 4.1; issue #742). Install: mkdir -p ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-~/.config}/mercury/bots && cp deploy/nightly-bot.json.example ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-~/.config}/mercury/bots/nightly.json, then 'mercury host bot validate --alias nightly'. All tasks use tz 'local': the host must run Europe/Warsaw so 'local' is Poznan time (parseTz has no IANA names, and a fixed offset like '+01:00' would miss the EU DST switch inside the 00:00-06:00 window). notAfterAt '06:00' ends every Run by 06:00 local on the fire date.",
  "api": {
    "url": "http://127.0.0.1:4620",
    "timeoutMs": 30000
  },
  "schedule": {
    "tasks": [
      {
        "name": "nightly-e2e",
        "cron": "5 0 * * *",
        "tz": "local",
        "singleFlight": true,
        "onMiss": "skip",
        "template": {
          "task": "nightly-e2e {{fire.date}}: run the E2E suite per .agents/skills/nightly/SKILL.md (e2e.ts); file or update defect issues; never ask; stay inside the 06:00 window.",
          "notAfterAt": "06:00",
          "constraints": {
            "maxDurationMs": 14400000,
            "maxRetries": 0
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nightly-next",
        "cron": "*/20 0-4 * * *",
        "tz": "local",
        "singleFlight": true,
        "onMiss": "skip",
        "template": {
          "task": "nightly-next {{fire.date}} {{fire.time}}: take the top rung of the nightly ladder per .agents/skills/nightly/SKILL.md (next.ts); finish or mark blocked; never ask; stay inside the 06:00 window.",
          "notAfterAt": "06:00",
          "constraints": {
            "maxDurationMs": 4800000,
            "maxRetries": 0
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nightly-report",
        "cron": "40 5 * * *",
        "tz": "local",
        "singleFlight": true,
        "onMiss": "skip",
        "template": {
          "task": "nightly-report {{fire.date}}: file the morning digest per .agents/skills/nightly/SKILL.md (report.ts); never ask; stay inside the 06:00 window.",
          "notAfterAt": "06:00",
          "constraints": {
            "maxDurationMs": 900000,
            "maxRetries": 0
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
